From 58b1ca9ab020b3a34f7a75a1b8810ea04fa73380 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 5 Jun 2026 14:32:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 730/913] core: add panic for abort type
 FAULT_TYPE_EXTERNAL_ABORT

For an external abort with type FAULT_TYPE_EXTERNAL_ABORT
a new function plat_external_abort_handler() can be used to manage
specific action. But if the error is not treated in this function
or when CFG_EXTERNAL_ABORT_PLAT_HANDLER=n, the error is not treated
and the system continue to treat exception in loop.

Before the commit 325d496372fc ("core: add platform-specific abort
handler"), a panic was executed in the default case, so this patch
force a reset when a external abort is received by calling panic().

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 0b76a2667e2135080e9a0ccfcdf34e0faaaee204 core: add panic for abort type FAULT_TYPE_EXTERNAL_ABORT]
Fixes: 325d496372fc ("core: add platform-specific abort handler")
Change-Id: Iab9f5b420439f986644ae4bf22517dd86a58496c
Signed-off-by: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/575298
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/kernel/abort.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/kernel/abort.c b/core/arch/arm/kernel/abort.c
index 6e337a8b9..203f54209 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/kernel/abort.c
+++ b/core/arch/arm/kernel/abort.c
@@ -574,6 +574,7 @@ void abort_handler(uint32_t abort_type, struct thread_abort_regs *regs)
 		/* Allow platform-specific handling */
 		plat_external_abort_handler(&ai);
 #endif
+		panic("external abort");
 		break;
 #ifdef CFG_WITH_VFP
 	case FAULT_TYPE_USER_MODE_VFP:
